    <summary>The SDK for developing Vulkan applications</summary>
    <description>

## Overview
The Vulkan SDK provides the development and runtime components to create, capture, and replay Vulkan applications.
The SDK also includes the runtime components to load and run Vulkan Layers.

## Upgrading notes
Vulkan SDK installer allows side-by-side installations of multiple versions and does not remove old versions.
This package does *not* implement any behavior to override that, so running `choco upgrade` will leave you with both old and new versions.
The old version has to be removed by either
- running `choco uninstall vulkan-sdk` *before* upgrading,
- manually uninstalling old version *after* upgrading.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>
https://vulkan.lunarg.com/doc/view/latest/windows/release_notes.html
    </releaseNotes>

